{"slug":"boosie-baddazz-claps-back-at-gabrielle-union-after-being-violated-taylor-bennett-also-weighs-in","postId":75423,"title":"Boosie Baddazz Claps Back At Gabrielle Union After Being Violated & Taylor Bennett Also Weighs-In","htmlContent":"<!-- wp:image {\"id\":520356,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Boosie-3-1024x646.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-520356\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">YouTube</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Boosie attacked Gabrielle Union for interviewing a \"ghetto hero,\" after she suggested he might be in the closet in an old interview.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Boosie Badazz spoke at length about the child of Dwayne Wade and Gabrielle Union over the years, making many comments about Zaya's transition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s5V1Jb3nGT4\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=s5V1Jb3nGT4\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The actress defended her teenage trans daughter in a Jemele Hill interview. After sharing that things with Zaya are \"so far so good,\" she added, \"sorry, Boosie,\" recognizing his hurtful comments on her child.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“You got alot of d*** on your mind,<a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2022/12/04/gabrielle-union-violates-boosie-baddazz-watch/\">” said Union</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>While the interview is over a year old, the video above surfaced and caught the rapper's attention. Boosie responded to Gabrielle Union in a diatribe on Twitter, criticizing her for questioning the virility of a \"ghetto hero\" as he shot Dwayne Wade.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/BOOSIEOFFICIAL/status/1599616115751034880?s=20u0026t=MGh0APY1pcS-lrQq-d_9jg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/BOOSIEOFFICIAL/status/1599616115751034880?s=20&amp;t=MGh0APY1pcS-lrQq-d_9jg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/BOOSIEOFFICIAL/status/1599596246871613441?s=20u0026t=MGh0APY1pcS-lrQq-d_9jg\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/BOOSIEOFFICIAL/status/1599596246871613441?s=20&amp;t=MGh0APY1pcS-lrQq-d_9jg\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Singer Taylor Bennett, who is also the brother of Chance The Rapper also weighed in on the back and forth between Union and Boosie.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"I love Boosie but the way he keep @ They family is BOGUS , you don’t got to embrace it or support it but I see folks talking bout gay stuff every day,\" said Bennett.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/ClxUrCPrD_H/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/ClxUrCPrD_H/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->","excerpt":"YouTube Boosie attacked Gabrielle Union for interviewing a \"ghetto hero,\" after she suggested he might be in the closet in an old interview. Boosie Badazz spoke at length about the child of Dwayne…","publishedAt":"2022-12-05T06:00:00Z","modifiedAt":"2022-12-05T06:00:00Z","author":{"slug":"tony-mcknight","displayName":"Tony McKnight"},"categories":[{"slug":"uncategorized","name":"Uncategorized"}],"tags":[{"slug":"byron-nelson","name":"Byron Nelson"},{"slug":"dwyane-wade","name":"Dwyane Wade"},{"slug":"entertainment-news","name":"Entertainment news"},{"slug":"gabrielle-union","name":"Gabrielle Union"},{"slug":"landon-buford","name":"Landon Buford"},{"slug":"taylor-bennett","name":"Taylor Bennett"}],"heroImage":{"originalUrl":"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Boosie-3-1024x646.jpg"},"inlineImageUrls":["http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Boosie-3-1024x646.jpg"],"readingTimeMin":1,"type":"post","link":"https://landonbuford.com/boosie-baddazz-claps-back-at-gabrielle-union-after-being-violated-taylor-bennett-also-weighs-in/"}